.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-piv-certificates-import 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-piv\-certificates\-import \- Import a certificate (PEM/DER/PKCS#12) into a slot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-piv\-certificates\-import\fR [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-management\-key\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISLOT\fR> <\fICERTIFICATE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Import a certificate (PEM/DER/PKCS#12) into a slot.
.PP
A PEM bundle holding several blocks (key plus certificate, or a certificate chain) contributes its first CERTIFICATE block; a PKCS#12 bundle contributes its leaf certificate.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-management\-key\fR \fI<MANAGEMENT_KEY>\fR
Current management key as 48 hex characters (prompted when needed)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISLOT\fR>
PIV slot
.TP
<\fICERTIFICATE\fR>
File containing the certificate (\*(Aq\-\*(Aq for stdin)
